        <ArticleTitle>Mechanical Thrombectomy Outcomes in Large Vessel Occlusion Stroke.</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND" NlmCategory="BACKGROUND">Large vessel occlusion stroke carries high morbidity.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="METHODS" NlmCategory="METHODS">We reviewed 250 patients undergoing thrombectomy with MRI perfusion selection.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="RESULTS" NlmCategory="RESULTS">Successful recanalization improved 90-day functional outcomes.</AbstractText>
